```console
$ scherzo-cloud github repository list --help
List repositories authorized for an installation

Usage: scherzo-cloud github repository list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <INSTALLATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INSTALLATION>  GitHub installation binding ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the GitHub result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
